00:53:21.659 [agent:output] [reviewer] {"approved":false,"blocking_issues":[{"id":"REV-001","severity":"high","file":"src/pages/partials/wip.astro","line":26,"description":"`wip` partial script was not migrated to page-lifecycle. Initialization still runs immediately (`init()`), and multiple DOM/Firebase/global listeners are registered without lifecycle cleanup (`URLStateManager.onPopState`, `onValue`, `document.addEventListener`, tab/button listeners), which can duplicate handlers on partial re-entry.","suggested_fix":"Import `{ registerCleanup, onPageEnter, onPageLeave }` from `/js/utils/page-lifecycle.js`, move initialization into `onPageEnter(() => { ... })`, collect all unsubscribe/remove-listener callbacks, and register a single teardown with `registerCleanup`."},{"id":"REV-002","severity":"high","file":"src/pages/partials/global-config.astro","line":10,"description":"`global-config` partial still uses inline initialization and adds `config-saved/config-deleted/config-created` listeners directly without cleanup, so listeners can accumulate after navigation.","suggested_fix":"Wrap setup in `onPageEnter`, keep stable handler references, and register `removeEventListener` cleanups via `registerCleanup`."},{"id":"REV-003","severity":"medium","file":"src/pages/partials/proposals.astro","line":6,"description":"`proposals` partial was not migrated to lifecycle pattern required by the task (no `onPageEnter`/cleanup integration).","suggested_fix":"Adopt the same lifecycle structure used in other migrated partials: import lifecycle helpers, execute page init in `onPageEnter`, and register teardown callbacks where applicable."},{"id":"REV-004","severity":"high","file":"public/js/utils/page-lifecycle.js","line":58,"description":"Lifecycle cleanup is wired to `page-before-cleanup` instead of `astro:before-swap` as required by the task contract, risking missed cleanup in standard Astro navigation flow.","suggested_fix":"Listen to `astro:before-swap` (or add it in addition to custom events if needed) and run `runCleanups()` from that event."},{"id":"REV-005","severity":"medium","file":"tests/utils/page-lifecycle.test.js","line":1,"description":"A new test file was introduced even though the task explicitly says not to create new tests and rely on existing regression suite.","suggested_fix":"Remove the newly added test file from this task scope and validate by running the existing test suite only."}],"non_blocking_suggestions":["After lifecycle migration, run the full existing test suite and include the pass result in the change evidence.","In `page-lifecycle.js`, consider exposing a documented `dispose` helper for batch teardowns to reduce per-page cleanup boilerplate."],"summary":"Rejected: required lifecycle refactor is incomplete on target partials, cleanup trigger does not match required Astro lifecycle event, and task scope was exceeded by adding new tests.","confidence":0.95} (stream=stderr)
